R('156-8',84,'J156-8-11:149-151','Z|°|Φ and Y|°|Z; |X|∩|Z|°≠∅','Z|°|Φ and not(Y|°|Z); |X|∩|Z|°=∅','A separating witness must be orthogonal to Φ and nonorthogonal to Y; the printed signs reverse the intended double-perpendicular criterion.')
